---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sedex SAQ: How to Fill the Self-Assessment Questionnaire"
  description="Step-by-step guide to the Sedex Self-Assessment Questionnaire (SAQ): sections, how to answer, common mistakes and how it links to your SMETA audit."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/post/sedex-self-assessment/"
  ogImage="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589793463357-5fb813435467?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85"
  keywords="Eurocert Asia,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
  noindex
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589793463357-5fb813435467?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=85" alt="Garment workers on a factory production line" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16] via-[#030a16]/80 to-[#030a16]/60"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-6 flex-wrap"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 heading-font text-[9px] font-bold text-eurogold-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 border border-eurogold-400/20"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400"></span>SEDEX</span><span class="text-white/30 text-xs">Posted On November 13, 2019</span><span class="text-white/30 text-xs">By admin</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Sedex SAQ: How to Fill the <span class="text-eurogold-400">Self-Assessment Questionnaire</span></h1><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white/80 text-sm heading-font mt-6"><span class="text-white/90">2019</span><span>/</span><span class="text-white/90">November</span><span>/</span><span class="text-white/70">Sedex SAQ</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Sedex SAQ <span class="text-euro-600">Importance</span></h2></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-euro-50 border border-euro-100"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list text-white text-lg"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Self Assessment Questionnaire (SAQ)</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The Sedex Self Assessment Questionnaire (SAQ) is a critical component of the Sedex audit process. It serves as the foundational document that suppliers complete to provide detailed information about their site&#x27;s labour standards, health &amp; safety, environment, and business ethics practices before a SMETA audit takes place.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">What Is the SAQ</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What Is the <span class="text-euro-600">Sedex SAQ?</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The Sedex Self-Assessment Questionnaire (SAQ) is an online questionnaire completed by suppliers on the Sedex platform. It captures information about a site's labour standards, health and safety, environment and business ethics before a SMETA audit takes place.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">A well-completed SAQ helps the audit team understand the site in advance and reduces the time spent gathering basic information on site. It also influences the risk rating that buyers see on the platform.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Sections</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">SAQ Sections <span class="text-euro-600">One by One</span></h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong class="text-slate-700">Company and site details:</strong> legal name, site address, workforce, products and activities.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-700">Labour standards:</strong> recruitment, wages, working hours, freedom of association, discrimination and disciplinary practices.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-700">Health and safety:</strong> hazards, risk assessments, emergency preparedness, accidents and training.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-700">Environment:</strong> waste, emissions, resource use and environmental management.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-700">Business ethics:</strong> anti-bribery, confidentiality and grievance mechanisms.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Each section should be answered from actual site practice, supported by records and policies that the audit team can review.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">How to Answer</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">How to Answer the <span class="text-euro-600">SAQ Accurately</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Answer every question based on documented practice. Where a question does not apply, explain why rather than leaving it blank. Keep supporting documents organised so they can be shared with the auditor.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Avoid over-claiming. Answers that cannot be supported by evidence during the audit create findings and damage the site's risk rating.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Updating</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">How Often Should You <span class="text-euro-600">Update the SAQ?</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Update the SAQ whenever site conditions change, such as new processes, workforce changes or new risks. Many suppliers review it at least annually and before each SMETA audit so the information stays current.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Common Mistakes</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Mistakes That Cause a <span class="text-euro-600">High Risk Rating</span></h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <li>Leaving sections incomplete or unanswered.</li>
        <li>Copying generic policy text that does not reflect site practice.</li>
        <li>Understating working hours or overstating wages.</li>
        <li>Failing to update the SAQ after changes to the site.</li>
        <li>Not keeping evidence ready for audit verification.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8fafc]">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Link to Audit</h4>
        <h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">How the SAQ Links to Your <span class="text-euro-600">SMETA Audit</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The auditor uses the SAQ to plan the audit and to cross-check answers against records and observations on site. Discrepancies between the SAQ and actual practice become findings. Completing the SAQ carefully is therefore the first step in a successful SMETA audit.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

