e/25 text-[10px] mb-1.5">December 4, 2019</p><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">CTPAT Compliance vs CTPAT Validation</p></div></a><a class="rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group block overflow-hidden" href="/post/ctpat-minimum-security-criteria/"><div class="h-32 overflow-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367726/eurocert/r2.png.png" alt="CTPAT - The NEW Minimum Security Criteria from CBP for Manufacturers and Exports" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-white/25 text-[10px] mb-1.5">December 4, 2019</p><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">CTPAT - The NEW Minimum Security Criteria from CBP for Manufacturers and Exports</p></div></a></div><div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between"><a class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/40 hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors group" href="/post/sa-8000-certification/"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left text-xs group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i><div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Previous Post</span><span class="text-xs text-white/30">SA8000 Certification</span></div></a><a class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/40 hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors group text-right" href="/post/ctpat-compliance-vs-validation/"><div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Next Post</span><span class="text-xs text-white/30">CTPAT Compliance vs CTPAT Validation</span></div><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-xs group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i></a></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
